[{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0030","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0030.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-1021","title":"Apple QuickTime 堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 7.4.5 之前版本的 Windows 平台存在 Animation 编解码器处理堆溢出漏洞。攻击者可向目标用户发送包含特制影片的诱饵文件，当用户使用受影响的 QuickTime 打开该影片文件时，编解码器在处理影片中的行程长度编码数据时触发堆缓冲区溢出，导致程序崩溃或在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有安装了 QuickTime 7.4.5 之前版本的 Windows 系统，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1021"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-04T17:44:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:50:49Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Windows 版 Apple QuickTime 升级至 7.4.5 或更高版本（建议升级至最新 7.7.9 版本）。可从 Apple 官网下载最新安装包（https://support.apple.com/kb/DL837）手动安装，或卸载旧版后使用 Apple Software Update 自动更新。若暂时无法升级，建议卸载 QuickTime 或在防火墙/应用层禁用 .mov/.qt 等 QuickTime 关联文件类型的自动打开，作为临时缓解措施。Apple 已于 2016 年停止对 Windows 版 QuickTime 的安全更新，建议长期迁移至其他媒体播放器（如 VLC、MPC-HC）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/29650","http://securitytracker.com/id?1019765","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT1241","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/490462/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28583","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA08-094A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/1078","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-08-018","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/41612","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e532da319bd448554f3195f38b855d2e9be0809/cves/2008/1xxx/CVE-2008-1021.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-1021","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2008-1021.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c38da4de9997eed21b6a4c71c4b194b6f142b8fc/CVE/data/2008/CVE-2008-1021.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34d23bc289ec08cf13b2c7e74563dcd9a8c17e9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-86x6-x7r9-8qmv/GHSA-86x6-x7r9-8qmv.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_745.nasl","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/macosx_Quicktime745.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_121800_121900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2008/CVE-2008-1021.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x29000/28583/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0029","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-1020","title":"Apple QuickTime 堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 在 Windows 系统上的 quickTime.qts 组件存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-119）。该漏洞是由于组件在处理 PICT 格式图像文件时未对 Kodak 编码的图像数据进行充分的错误检查，导致远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的 PICT 图像文件触发堆溢出。受影响的版本为 Windows 平台上的 QuickTime 7.4.5 及更早版本。攻击条件：攻击者需诱使用户打开或预览一个特制的 PICT 图像文件（如通过电子邮件附件、网络下载等方式）。成功利用后，攻击者可在用户系统中以当前用户权限执行任意代码，造成程序崩溃或完全接管目标系统，对数据机密性、完整性和可用性均造成严重影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1020"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-04T17:44:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:50:49Z","remediation":"立即将 Windows 系统上的 Apple QuickTime 升级至 7.4.5 或更高版本，该修复包含在 Apple 安全更新 2008-003 中，可通过 Apple 软件更新功能自动安装。如 QuickTime 非必需，可暂时卸载以消除攻击面。日常使用中应避免打开来历不明的 PICT 图像文件，以缓解该缓冲区溢出漏洞导致的远程代码执行风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/29650","http://securitytracker.com/id?1019764","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT1241","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/490468/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28583","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA08-094A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/1078","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-08-017","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/41610","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b4a89b44478cf1ae516da29bd6f16b00a8bec011/cves/2008/1xxx/CVE-2008-1020.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-1020","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2008-1020.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d2521a6a6a6b95fdd6c2651e419302899bbee89/CVE/data/2008/CVE-2008-1020.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/99cae226d61b8e74336dc0c5e362f6c067c34ab5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-c9ff-grjw-39ph/GHSA-c9ff-grjw-39ph.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_745.nasl","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/macosx_Quicktime745.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_121800_121900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2008/CVE-2008-1020.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x29000/28583/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0028","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-1019","title":"Apple QuickTime PICT图像文件解析缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 媒体播放器在解析 PICT 图像文件时，quickTime.qts 组件中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于内存复制循环未正确终止，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 PICT 图像文件，诱使用户在 QuickTime 中打开或查看该文件，从而触发缓冲区溢出并执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 QuickTime 7.4.5 之前的所有版本，攻击无需身份认证，用户仅需打开恶意图像文件即可遭利用，可导致程序崩溃或在受影响系统上获得与用户相同的执行权限。Apple 在 QuickTime 7.4.5 中修复了此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1019"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-04T17:44:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:50:49Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple QuickTime 升级至 7.4.5 或更高版本，可通过系统软件更新功能或访问 Apple 支持网站（support.apple.com/kb/HT1241）下载安装安全更新。如暂时无法升级，建议避免打开来历不明的 PICT 图像文件，并在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/29650","http://securitytracker.com/id?1019763","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT1241","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/490459/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28583","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA08-094A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/1078","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-08-014","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/41609","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe1f2cb931ec10d1e039a6fd54386a966f969658/cves/2008/1xxx/CVE-2008-1019.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-1019","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2008-1019.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e42471f11b569c31aa66236a559376c1c33d96f2/CVE/data/2008/CVE-2008-1019.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0028562b44fe8ba49728d9c355cac8b5dcaf39ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-gwmp-h99r-jccg/GHSA-gwmp-h99r-jccg.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_745.nasl","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/macosx_Quicktime745.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_121800_121900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2008/CVE-2008-1019.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x29000/28583/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0027","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-1018","title":"Apple QuickTime 堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags as requested.<value>该漏洞源于 Apple QuickTime 在解析 MP4A 格式电影文件中的 Channel Compositor（chan）原子时存在堆缓冲区溢出缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造包含畸形 chan 原子的特制 MP4A 电影文件，诱使目标用户使用 QuickTime 7.4.5 之前版本打开，从而触发缓冲区溢出并在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响安装 QuickTime 7.4.5 之前版本的 Windows 及 Mac OS X 系统，CVSS 评分为 6.8，利用条件要求用户交互（打开恶意文件），成功利用可导致攻击者获得与当前用户相同的权限并执行任意操作。Apple 已在 QuickTime 7.4.5 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1018"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-04T17:44:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:50:49Z","remediation":"Apple 已发布 QuickTime 7.4.5 修复此漏洞，请将 Windows 和 Mac 系统上的 QuickTime 播放器升级至 7.4.5 或更高版本。如当前版本低于 7.4.5，建议立即从 Apple 官网下载升级包进行安装。若短期内无法升级，可暂时卸载 QuickTime 或限制浏览器自动打开在线电影文件，并避免打开来历不明的 .mp4 或电影文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2008//Jul/msg00000.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/29650","http://secunia.com/advisories/31034","http://securitytracker.com/id?1019762","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT1241","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/490467/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28583","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA08-094A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/1078","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/2064/references","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-08-016","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/41606","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/721f5647080ad234b0e7db49f4cb7a1a1f72d604/cves/2008/1xxx/CVE-2008-1018.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-1018","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2008-1018.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ffd57c03ae1089460fd6f5c8a0b1d7efb29040a8/CVE/data/2008/CVE-2008-1018.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/39d8887723797efc1804585dd06585c9fd751226/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-83f2-xwx7-c589/GHSA-83f2-xwx7-c589.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_745.nasl","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/macosx_Quicktime745.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_121800_121900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2008/CVE-2008-1018.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x29000/28583/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0026","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-1017","title":"Apple QuickTime 堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"QuickTime 的 quicktime.qts 组件在处理电影文件中的裁剪区域（clipping region，简称 crgn）原子时存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可构造包含特制裁剪区域数据的恶意电影文件，当用户使用低于 7.4.5 版本的 Apple QuickTime 打开该文件时，程序在解析 crgn 原子过程中触发堆溢出，导致程序崩溃或在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 及 macOS 平台上所有 QuickTime 7.4.5 之前的版本，攻击者需诱导用户打开恶意电影文件才能利用成功，利用条件要求一定的用户交互。Apple 已在 QuickTime 7.4.5 及后续版本中修复了该漏洞，CVSS v3 评分为 6.8，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1017"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-04T17:44:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:50:48Z","remediation":"建议将 Apple QuickTime 升级至 7.4.5 或更高版本，修复 quicktime.qts 中 crgn atom 处理函数的堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可暂时卸载 QuickTime 或禁用浏览器中的 QuickTime 插件作为临时缓解措施，并避免打开来源不可信的 .mov 及 .pict 媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2008//Jul/msg00000.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/29650","http://secunia.com/advisories/31034","http://securitytracker.com/id?1019761","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT1241","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/490460/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28583","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA08-094A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/1078","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/2064/references","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-08-015","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/41607","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/84a32f54509ea69818fd2f28519fed9f2968cec3/cves/2008/1xxx/CVE-2008-1017.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-1017","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2008-1017.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4efe50030f98e26c62a2548f14fe89d9f72e2021/CVE/data/2008/CVE-2008-1017.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34faa994a969a96da73434c6e96d687fa245753/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-36gw-23f9-q2qg/GHSA-36gw-23f9-q2qg.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_745.nasl","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/macosx_Quicktime745.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_121800_121900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2008/CVE-2008-1017.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x29000/28583/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0025","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-1016","title":"Apple QuickTime 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 在 7.4.5 及更早版本中处理电影媒体轨道时存在内存破坏漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造特制电影文件（如 MOV、MP4 等格式）触发内存损坏，进而执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows、Macintosh 等多个平台上的 QuickTime 用户，攻击者可制作含有恶意电影文件的网页链接或直接发送文件，诱骗用户用存在漏洞的 QuickTime 打开播放，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1016"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-04T17:44:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:50:48Z","remediation":"立即将 QuickTime 升级到 7.4.5 或更高版本。打开 iTunes，依次选择「帮助」→「检查更新」，或前往 Apple 官网下载安装 QuickTime 7.4.5 安全更新。对于无需使用 QuickTime 的 Windows 主机，建议通过「控制面板」→「程序和功能」直接卸载。如暂时无法升级，应在系统防火墙或邮件网关处拦截 .mov、.qt、.pict 等 QuickTime 相关文件扩展名，避免打开来历不明的媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/29650","http://securitytracker.com/id?1019760","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT1241","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28583","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA08-094A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/1078","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/41605","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/10542eebf1e993745def113b14941719ae818f2d/cves/2008/1xxx/CVE-2008-1016.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-1016","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2008-1016.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc4d86fa626798689c9cd6668d1881354e44e4cf/CVE/data/2008/CVE-2008-1016.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34faa994a969a96da73434c6e96d687fa245753/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-rg23-wf5c-rhrf/GHSA-rg23-wf5c-rhrf.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_745.nasl","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/macosx_Quicktime745.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_121800_121900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2008/CVE-2008-1016.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x29000/28583/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0024","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-1015","title":"Apple QuickTime 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 7.4.5 之前版本的数据引用原子（data reference atom）处理模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-119）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造特制的电影文件，诱使用户使用 QuickTime 打开查看，当受害者打开恶意电影文件时触发缓冲区溢出，从而导致应用程序崩溃或在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac 等多平台的 QuickTime 播放器用户，攻击无需事先获取账户凭据，攻击复杂度中等，用户只需正常打开一个恶意媒体文件即可被攻击。Apple 已在 QuickTime 7.4.5 版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1015"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-04T17:44:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:50:48Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apple QuickTime 至 7.4.5 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，可通过控制面板卸载 QuickTime 或禁用浏览器中的 QuickTime  ActiveX 控件作为临时缓解措施，并避免打开来源不可信的 .mov 或 .mp4 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2008//Jul/msg00000.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/29650","http://secunia.com/advisories/31034","http://securitytracker.com/id?1019759","http://support.apple.c