开该影片后，QuickTime 会在未充分验证的情况下访问外部资源，从而向攻击者泄露敏感信息。漏洞影响安装低于 7.4.5 版本 QuickTime 的 Windows 等主机，攻击需用户交互（如下载/打开特制影片），CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中等。Apple 已在 QuickTime 7.4.5 中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1014"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-04T17:44:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:50:48Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple QuickTime 升级至 7.4.5 或更高版本；Windows 用户可通过 Apple 官网下载安装包覆盖安装，Mac 用户通过软件更新获取。若无法立即升级，应暂时禁用 QuickTime 浏览器插件、避免打开来源不明的电影文件，并在防火墙/代理层拦截对不可信外部 URL 的自动请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/29650","http://securitytracker.com/id?1019758","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT1241","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28583","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA08-094A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/1078","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/41602","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2008/1xxx/CVE-2008-1014.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-1014","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2008-1014.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2008/CVE-2008-1014.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-84xp-prf7-vf66/GHSA-84xp-prf7-vf66.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_745.nasl","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/macosx_Quicktime745.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_121800_121900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2008/CVE-2008-1014.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2008/AVE-2008-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2008-0021","file_name":"2008/AVE-2008-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2008-1013","title":"Apple QuickTime 代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 7.4.5 之前版本存在反序列化漏洞，未受信任的 Java 小程序可反序列化 QTJava 对象，导致远程攻击者通过精心构造的恶意 Applet 执行任意代码。该漏洞影响安装在 Windows 系统上的 QuickTime 7.4.5 之前版本，CVSS 评分 6.8（中等危害），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度中等，无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（如访问恶意网页运行 Applet）。攻击者可诱导用户访问包含恶意 Java Applet 的网页，利用 QTJava 反序列化缺陷获取提升权限并在目标系统执行任意代码。Apple 已在 QuickTime 7.4.5 版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 7.4.5 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2008-1013"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2008-04-04T17:44:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:50:48Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apple QuickTime 至 7.4.5 或更高版本（可通过 Apple 官网下载安装）。如暂无法升级，可在浏览器中禁用 Java 插件或卸载 QuickTime Java 插件（QTJava.zip）作为临时缓解措施，防止恶意 Java Applet 利用 QTJava 反序列化漏洞执行任意代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/29650","http://securitytracker.com/id?1019757","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT1241","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/28583","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA08-094A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/1078","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/41601","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2008/CVE-2008-1013.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2008/1xxx/CVE-2008-1013.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2008/CVE-2008-1013","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2008/C